      "tag": "Adding",
      "h2": "Adding fractions",
      "body_html": "<p>Add <strong>1/4 + 1/2</strong>.</p><p>Common denominator is 4: 1/2 = 2/4.</p><p>1/4 + 2/4 = <strong>3/4</strong>.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Subtracting",
      "h2": "Subtracting fractions",
      "body_html": "<p>Subtract <strong>2/3 − 1/6</strong>.</p><p>Common denominator is 6: 2/3 = 4/6.</p><p>4/6 − 1/6 = <strong>3/6 = 1/2</strong>.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Multiplying",
      "h2": "Multiplying fractions",
      "body_html": "<p>Multiply top × top and bottom × bottom.</p><p>2/3 × 4/5 = (2 × 4) ÷ (3 × 5) = <strong>8/15</strong>.</p>"
    }
